      },
      "message": "fix(post): G76 R comes from the rounded words' own ladder\n\nThe control reads the posted words, each rounded to the least increment\non its own. Under G20 the default thread posted Q157 P472 R0.0157: k - d\n= 0.0315 sat one ten-thousandth past the second rung 0.0314, so the\ncontrol cut a fourth, unverified pass. R is now derived from the rounded\nQ (first depth), Q (minimum depth) and P (thread height): the allowance\nwhose last rough depth lies above rung N-1 and at or below rung N of the\nrounded ladder, nearest the record's (inch golden: R0.0158). More than\none least increment from the record's allowance is refused by name.\n\nPinned by lathe_post_g76_schedule::the_default_thread_g76_states_its_three_passes_in_inch\nand ::a_ladder_the_rounded_words_cannot_state_is_refused_by_name.\n\nRefs #417\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
